sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as AgentRunner
  participant M as Chat Model
  participant T as Business Tool
  participant R as RAG Retriever
  participant DB as Database/pgvector
  U->>A: question
  A->>M: messages + JSON tool schemas
  M-->>A: structured tool call
  A->>T: validate arguments and execute
  T->>DB: read live product/inventory/order facts
  DB-->>T: authoritative result
  A->>R: retrieve filtered evidence
  R->>DB: keyword + vector search
  DB-->>R: versioned chunks
  R-->>A: evidence + citation locator
  A->>M: tool results + evidence
  M-->>A: grounded Chinese answer
  A-->>U: answer + citations or human handoff
